Package release: v0.3.12 (packed version 312).

The package record binds a deterministic provider-hosted HTTPS source artifact
containing the reviewed Neutron workspace source and important build inputs for
these package bytes. It is a source snapshot, not a reproducible-build claim.

The package also carries installed npm and Mops legal materials, including the
exact audited owner-license decision for 3V Interactive-owned code in icblast@4.3.0. That
decision excludes icblast/didc_wasm_pkg and makes no claim about third-party
rights in that path.

The modified browser compiler is maintained in its own source repository.
packages/neutron-motoko-wasm/LICENSES.md identifies its immutable source
revision, build command, generated-asset checksums, license texts, and the
corresponding js_of_ocaml/wasm_of_ocaml runtime source. The provider-hosted
Kernel source artifact and those pinned no-charge compiler source locations
together provide the source for this package; this repository intentionally
does not duplicate the compiler repository or its complete build closure.
3V Interactive remains responsible for keeping the referenced source available
for the period required by the applicable licenses.

Generating or building this candidate does not publish it.
